Error [E0712]: This `#FX` region uses the effect `FS, IO`, which it has no authority for
  --> tests/ui/grant_out_of_set.jet:4:20
    |
  4 |     #FX(authority: Net) {
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: `#FX(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: Add `FS, IO` to the `#FX(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0712
